  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under GASB 75, net OPEB liability equals total OPEB liability minus plan fiduciary net position. Because Maplewood has no trust, plan assets are zero, so the full $14.3 million total OPEB liability is reported as the net OPEB liability on the government-wide Statement of Net Position.
Wrong (A): A deferred outflow of resources is not a substitute for recognizing the OPEB liability; deferred outflows arise from specific transactions like employer contributions after the measurement date.
Wrong (B): GASB 75 requires full recognition of the liability on the face of the financial statements regardless of funding status, not just note disclosure.
